# 🎮 Playful Guide: How to Test the KnQ Reels NFT & Auction Flow

Welcome! This step-by-step guide is designed to help you easily test the **KnQ Reels** auction and digital collectible (NFT) features. 

You don't need any technical knowledge or real money. Everything runs in a safe "playground" network using free test coins!

---

## 🛠️ Step 1: Get Your Digital Wallet (MetaMask)
To buy and bid on digital collectibles, you need a digital wallet. Think of it like a secure digital passport for the app.

1. Go to **[metamask.io](https://metamask.io/)** on your computer.
2. Click **Download** and install the extension for your web browser (Chrome, Brave, Edge, etc.).
3. Open MetaMask (the little fox icon in your browser toolbar) and click **Create a new wallet**.
4. Set a password and follow the simple on-screen instructions.
   * *⚠️ **Important Note**: You will be shown a list of 12 secret words. Write them down on a physical piece of paper and keep them safe. This is your only backup!*

---

## 🌐 Step 2: Switch to the safe "Playground" Network
To make sure we are not spending real money, we need to switch your wallet to our safe playground network called **Polygon Amoy Testnet**.

1. Open your MetaMask (click the fox icon).
2. Click the network selector in the top-left corner of the popup (it usually says **Ethereum Mainnet**).
3. Click **Add network**, then click **Add a network manually** at the bottom of the list.
4. Simply copy and paste these details into the boxes:
   * **Network Name:** `Polygon Amoy Testnet`
   * **New RPC URL:** `https://rpc-amoy.polygon.technology`
   * **Chain ID:** `80002`
   * **Currency Symbol:** `MATIC`
   * **Block Explorer URL:** `https://amoy.polygonscan.com`
5. Click **Save** and select **Switch to Polygon Amoy Testnet** if prompted.

---

## 💰 Step 3: Get Free Test Coins
Now, let's load up your wallet with some free test coins so you have "playground funds" to bid!

1. Open MetaMask and click on the **Account** name at the top to copy your wallet address (it looks like a long code starting with `0x...`).
2. Go to this free coin dispenser website: **[Amoy Faucet](https://faucet.circle.com/)** or **[Polygon Faucet](https://faucet.polygon.technology/)**.
3. Paste your copied address into the text box and click **Submit / Send Me MATIC**.
4. Wait about 15–30 seconds. Open MetaMask, and you will see your free test coins arrive!

---

## 🚀 Step 4: Test the Marketplace & Auction Flow
Now you are fully funded and ready to test!

### 1. Connect Your Wallet to KnQ Reels
* Open the **KnQ Reels** web application.
* Click the **Connect Wallet** button (found in the top navigation bar or on your Profile page).
* A MetaMask popup will appear asking if you want to connect. Click **Connect** and then **Sign** to link your profile.

### 2. Place a Bid on an Auction
* Go to the **Marketplace** or the **Active Auctions** page.
* Select any active item you like.
* Enter a bid amount in the box and click **Place Bid**.
* MetaMask will pop up and ask you to confirm the bid. Click **Confirm**. 
* *🎉 Congratulations! You have successfully placed an on-chain bid using your test coins!*

### 3. Win the Auction & Receive Your NFT
* Once the auction timer ends, the winner is determined.
* The KnQ Reels system automatically packages the digital media and secures it permanently.
* Go to your **Profile** and click on your **Collection** tab.
* You will see your brand new, authentic **KnQ Reels NFT** sitting beautifully in your collection! You can click on it to see its unique on-chain details or show it off!

---

## 💡 Quick Tips for Testing
* **Test Bidding Wars:** You can open another browser tab, create a second MetaMask account, get test coins for it, and bid against yourself to watch the prices update in real-time!
* **No Real Money:** Remember, you can never accidentally spend real money because you are safely connected to the **Amoy Testnet** playground network.

Have fun testing! If you have any questions or get stuck on a step, just let us know. 🚀
